    <description>BRD Contact Cadence: Automates Day 0, 5, 35, 65, 95 contact attempt schedule for Named Successor Enactment cases. Creates tasks via two mechanisms: (1) Scheduled paths at Day 5/35/65/95 if Contact_Attempt_Count__c matches, OR (2) Manual recording via LWC sets Next_Task_Scheduled_At__c to NOW+2min, giving agents grace period to correct mistakes before task creation. Stops automation when Contact_Established__c = TRUE.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Case Succession Contact Cadence {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Case: Succession Contact Cadence</label>
